  "valuation": {
    "method": "Loss-making growth company: forward EV/revenue. Target-date (Nov 2027) investor prices NTM revenue (about FY2028). Equity = (NTM revenue x EV/revenue + net cash at target date) / ~18.5B fully diluted shares (about 18.1B implied by the $1.5T fully diluted value at the $83 IPO price, plus about 2% dilution). Net cash starts near $213B (about $131.8B cash and short-term investments at 2026-09-30 plus about $81.3B IPO proceeds) and is reduced for compute capex burn; debt and exact diluted count are not verified from the filing, so net cash and share count are model assumptions. USD listing, no FX. Operating loss was only $1.26B on $33.2B 9M revenue; the $104B net loss is mostly non-cash fair-value changes.",
